  "description": "BlazorModalPlus is a Blazor library that provides Bootstrap 5-based modal dialog components. These components are highly customizable and fit a variety of confirmation and dialog use cases. Additionally, multi-language support is added with improved accessibility and performance.",
  "frameworkReferences": "",
